      "side": 1,
      "message": "No. `mpu.h` doesn\u0027t exist for Cortex-M0. So the parser doesn\u0027t see the function definition.\n\nIf we really need to use `IS_ENABLED()`, we probably should add\n```\n#ifndef CONFIG_ROLLBACK_MPU_PROTECT\n#define mpu_lock_rollback(x)\n#endif\n```\nin this file.",
